      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i've had migraines my whole life and i know how they feel... this just feels like a really bad flare up. i'm kinda scared to go to the er if i don't have to, it's always such a hassle and so expensive. if i just take an extra pill and lay down in a dark room for a couple hours, won't that be enough to tell if it's just a migraine? i'm pretty sure it's just the usual stuff, just more intense.",
